# PHP Coding Standards & Best Practices

Universal PHP coding standards for Laravel 12 applications with PHP 8.2+.

## PSR Standards Compliance

### PSR-1: Basic Coding Standard

```php
<?php

namespace App\Http\Controllers;

// ✅ GOOD: Proper namespace and class declaration
class MarketController extends Controller
{
    // Class constants in UPPER_CASE
    public const MAX_MARKETS_PER_PAGE = 20;

    // Properties in camelCase
    protected MarketService $marketService;

    // Methods in camelCase
    public function index(): Response
    {
        // Method body
    }
}
```

